            "rationale": "Measured locally with the exact copper.objective.score on problem.npz: loss_total 6.52492, 0 label mismatches, contact_rmse 0.26575, runtime 1.27 s, public selfcheck passed. This improves the measured parent baseline (loss 405.0796, 54 mismatches) and beats alternatives tested this round: quadratic surface + Nelder-Mead (7.4473), normalized Gaussian RBF (6.577-6.585), fixed-offset IDW (6.581-6.588), and Voronoi surface (6.56 at offset 0.25). The search uses only public inputs and skfmm; all loops are bounded and the output is contiguous float64 with both signs.",
